sequenceDiagram
    participant Carla as CARLA
    participant Sionna as Sionna RT
    participant Perc as Perception (PointPillars/V2X-ViT/GRU)
    participant DT as Digital Twin State
    participant Trust as Trust Estimator
    participant Crit as Criticality Estimator
    participant AP as TwinTrust-AP (TAHS+FSDP)
    participant Exec as Execution Layer

    Carla->>Sionna: scene geometry, vehicle positions
    Sionna->>Perc: CSI, SNR, path loss, beam info
    Perc->>DT: predicted channel state + uncertainty
    DT->>Trust: current state
    DT->>Crit: current state
    Trust->>AP: T_t
    Crit->>AP: C_t
    AP->>Exec: horizon H_t, action A_t
    Exec->>DT: synchronization / beam update / comm mode
    Exec-->>Carla: (next cycle) runtime feedback
